---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { LINKS } from '../config/links';

const title = "Book your free call | Way of Wealth";
const description = "You've seen where your money goes. Book a free 20-minute call and let's work out the one habit to change first.";
const CALENDLY = 'https://calendly.com/thewayofwealth-official/20min';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={`${LINKS.siteUrl}/cash-flow-booking`} noindex={true}>

<link is:inline rel="stylesheet" href="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.css" />

<section class="cfb-wrap">
  <div class="cfb-confirm">
    <span class="cfb-tick">✓</span>
    <div>Nice work. Your report’s ready just below — then let’s do the bit a PDF can’t.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cfb-report" id="cfb-report" style="display:none">
    <span class="cfb-report-txt">📄 <b>Your Cash Flow Model report</b> is ready.</span>
    <button class="cfb-report-btn" id="cfb-dl" type="button">Download report</button>
  </div>

  <div class="cfb-hero">
    <p class="cfb-eyebrow">One last step</p>
    <h1 class="cfb-h1">You’ve seen the gap. <em>Now let’s close it.</em></h1>
    <p class="cfb-sub">The report shows you where the money goes. A call is where we work out the one habit driving it — and the first move to make this month. Free, straight-talking, no pitch you didn’t ask for.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cfb-cols">
    <div class="cfb-cal-card">
      <div class="calendly-inline-widget" data-url={CALENDLY} style="min-width:320px;height:680px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cfb-side">
      <h3 class="cfb-side-h">What happens on the call</h3>
      <ol class="cfb-what">
        <li><span class="cfb-n">1</span><div>We look at <b>your actual numbers</b> from the report — no starting from scratch.</div></li>
        <li><span class="cfb-n">2</span><div>We find the <b>one leak</b> costing you most, and why it keeps happening.</div></li>
        <li><span class="cfb-n">3</span><div>You leave with <b>one move</b> to make this month — whether or not we work together.</div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="cfb-side-foot">Twenty minutes. On Zoom. No slides, no pressure.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cfb-testis">
    <p class="cfb-eyebrow cfb-center">Don’t take my word for it</p>
    <h2 class="cfb-th">People who were exactly where you are</h2>

    <div class="cfb-feature-wrap">
      <video class="cfb-feature-vid" controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/testimonials/josh-book-the-call.jpg" src="/testimonials/josh-book-the-call.mp4"></video>
      <blockquote class="cfb-feature">
        “Book that first call with Joel. Just do it — one call is all it takes.”
        <cite>— Josh, yacht chef · came in stuck in debt, left debt-free and on a five-year plan</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <div class="cfb-grid">
      <div class="cfb-card">
        <video class="cfb-vid-el" controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/testimonials/josh-pedestal.jpg" src="/testimonials/josh-pedestal.mp4"></video>
        <div class="cfb-cbody"><p class="cfb-quote">“You’ve taken money off the pedestal and put me back on it. Now it’s a tool — I’m in control of it, not the other way round.”</p><p class="cfb-name">— Josh, yacht chef</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cfb-card">
        <video class="cfb-vid-el" controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/testimonials/shambhavi-worth.jpg" src="/testimonials/shambhavi-worth.mp4"></video>
        <div class="cfb-cbody"><p class="cfb-quote">Left calmer about money — and clear on her worth, no longer settling for less than she deserves.</p><p class="cfb-name">— Shambhavi, finishing her master’s</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cfb-card">
        <video class="cfb-vid-el" controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/testimonials/alon-opportunity.jpg" src="/testimonials/alon-opportunity.mp4"></video>
        <div class="cfb-cbody"><p class="cfb-quote">From avoiding money as “just status” to seeing it as a tool for freedom — and now planning his own studio.</p><p class="cfb-name">— Alon, personal trainer</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cfb-footnote">
    <div class="cfb-cred"><b>Joel Ezekiel</b> · MSc Behavioural Economics | Qualified Financial Planner</div>
    Your figures stayed on your device — we only ever received your email. This tool is an educational estimate, not financial advice.
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" async></script>

<script is:inline>
  // Deliver the report that was built on the tool page and stashed on-device.
  (function () {
    var data = sessionStorage.getItem('cf_report_pdf');
    if (!data) return;
    var bar = document.getElementById('cfb-report'), btn = document.getElementById('cfb-dl');
    if (!bar || !btn) return;
    bar.style.display = 'flex';
    function dl() {
      var a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = data; a.download = 'way-of-wealth-cash-flow-model.pdf';
      document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove();
    }
    btn.addEventListener('click', dl);
    // Auto-deliver a short while after they land, so the booking page gets the
    // first look. The button above is always available. Change DELAY_MS to taste.
    var DELAY_MS = 10000;
    if (sessionStorage.getItem('cf_report_delivered') !== '1') {
      setTimeout(function () { dl(); sessionStorage.setItem('cf_report_delivered', '1'); }, DELAY_MS);
    }
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .cfb-wrap { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8rem 1.25rem 6rem; }
  .cfb-eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-gold); font-weight: 600; }
  .cfb-center { text-align: center; display: block; }

  .cfb-confirm { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; background: rgba(63,122,85,0.09); border: 1px solid rgba(63,122,85,0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-charcoal); }
  .cfb-report { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 0.8rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-gold); border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem; }
  .cfb-report-txt { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--color-navy); }
  .cfb-report-btn { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; background: var(--color-navy); color: var(--color-cream); border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .cfb-report-btn:hover { background: var(--color-navy-deep); }
  .cfb-confirm b { color: var(--color-navy); }
  .cfb-tick { width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F7A55; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; flex: none; font-size: 14px; }

  .cfb-hero { margin: 2.2rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .cfb-h1 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.08; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0.8rem 0 0; }
  .cfb-h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--color-gold); }
  .cfb-sub { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 17px; color: var(--color-slate); max-width: 58ch; margin: 1rem 0 0; }

  .cfb-cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr; gap: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; align-items: start; }
  .cfb-cal-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm); border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(28,42,58,0.08); overflow: hidden; }
  .cfb-side { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.6rem 1.6rem; }
  .cfb-side-h { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0; }
  .cfb-what { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.1rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .cfb-what li { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-slate); }
  .cfb-what b { color: var(--color-navy); }
  .cfb-n { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(196,162,101,0.16); color: #9F7C34; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; display: grid; place-items: center; flex: none; }
  .cfb-side-foot { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-slate); margin: 1.4rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm); }

  .cfb-testis { margin-top: 3rem; }
  .cfb-th { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.4vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy); text-align: center; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
  .cfb-feature { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.7rem); line-height: 1.32; color: var(--color-navy); text-align: center; max-width: 42ch; margin: 1.8rem auto 0; }
  .cfb-feature cite { display: block; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-style: normal; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-slate); margin-top: 1rem; }
  .cfb-feature-wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 1.8rem auto 0; }
  .cfb-feature-vid { width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; display: block; background: #1C2A3A; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(28,42,58,0.14); }
  .cfb-feature-wrap .cfb-feature { margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .cfb-vid-el { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; display: block; background: #1C2A3A; }
  .cfb-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .cfb-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(28,42,58,0.06); }
  .cfb-vid { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: linear-gradient(140deg, #1C2A3A, #2C3F53); display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .cfb-play { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(245,240,232,0.94); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--color-navy); }
  .cfb-cbody { padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem; }
  .cfb-quote { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
  .cfb-name { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--color-slate); margin: 0.65rem 0 0; }

  .cfb-footnote { margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-slate); line-height: 1.6; }
  .cfb-cred { color: var(--color-slate); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .cfb-cred b { color: var(--color-navy); }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .cfb-wrap { padding-top: 6rem; }
    .cfb-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cfb-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

</Layout>
